  "description": "nMiti lunar calibration corpus - golden fixtures. Live-crawled publisher boundary receipts for the lunar panchang limbs, with per-receipt provenance. Times are NPT (UTC+05:45); resolved UTC = published_npt minus 05:45. Window Oct 18 - Nov 4, 2026 (BS Kartik 1-18, 2083; includes the Dashain and Kojagrat Purnima stretch). All pages were final at crawl time (crawled 2026-11-04, the last window day), so unlike the Nov corpus no advance-crawl re-verification is needed. Rows with prev_gap=true mark that the immediately-previous element boundary in that chain was not displayed by the source (interval spans two limb steps, 38-58 h).",
